  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Unknown_Regions\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions\">Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>When you react to an attack, your acrobatics training improves your mobility.</p><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> 13, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dodge\" title=\"Dodge\">Dodge</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mobility\" title=\"Mobility\">Mobility</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill_Focus_(Acrobatics)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill Focus (Acrobatics)\">Skill Focus (Acrobatics)</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> Once per encounter, as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a>, if a melee attack misses you, you can immediately move into an adjacent square without provoking an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack of Opportunity\">Attack of Opportunity</a>.</p><p><b>Special:</b> You must be aware of the attacker to benefit from this Feat. You can use this Feat a second time during the encounter by spending a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a>.</p>",
